#message:07:0C7
{
[Style Right]
What's up? I love to tell stories.[BR]
[Pause 12]Some people like to call me the[BR]
[Rainbow]King of Yapping[/fx].[Pause 6] Only some though.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
I'm no rakugo artist or nothing,[BR]
but it's still a lot of fun for me.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
If you have some time, I could[BR]
share some stories from around the[BR]
world. Might be interesting, hey?[BR]
[Yield][End]
}

#message:07:0C8
{
[Style Right]
Heya! You wanna hear more stories?[BR]
I got lots of 'em.[BR][Yield][End]
}

#message:07:0C9
{
[Style Right]
With enough bickering from her[BR]
flowers, Lip fell into a state of[BR]
depression for many days to come.[BR]
[Wait][next]
She sobbed to her mother, asking[BR]
why can't everyone be happy.[BR]
[Pause 10]She desperately wanted the arguing[BR]
to cease.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Lip had one final idea to calm the[BR]
flowers of [SaveColor][Color:1E]Flower Land[RestoreColor].[BR]
[Pause 12]She would sacrifice herself to put[BR]
them all at peace.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Cordelia stated it would not be a[BR]
simple sacrifice, however.[BR]
[Pause 10]To give up her life would mean to[BR]
forget all of her memories.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
She would be reborn in a brand[BR]
new life with no recollection of[BR]
her past with the goddess.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Furthermore, she would only keep her[BR]
goal of wanting to pursue a passion[BR]
of gardening.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
So she agreed to give up her life[BR]
to Cordelia and the flowers made a[BR]
pact to never tell Lip who she really[BR]
was in her next coming.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
But it wasn't enough.[Pause 10][BR]
Eventually the disputes unearthed[BR]
themselves again and Flower Land[BR]
was filled with more anger.[BR]
[Wait][End]
}


#message:07:0CA
{
[Style Right]
The anger beckoned...[BR]
And without any aid from Lip or[BR]
the Goddess, a calamity was soon[BR]
to fall upon Flower Land.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
A yokai was roosting beneath the[BR]
soil, waiting for a chance to strike.[BR]
[Pause 10]Before long, that's when the evil[BR]
[SaveColor][Color:01]Lord of Thunder[RestoreColor] rained hell.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
No longer was Flower Land the happy[BR]
place it used to be... until you came[BR]
along that is.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
You were able to restore it.[BR]
You even gathered the help of Lip,[BR]
who used the kernels of nature to[BR]
re-open the gateway.[BR]
[Wait][Next]
Very powerful, you are.[BR]
To be able to banish such an evil[BR]
being of wrath.[BR]
[Wait][End]
}